  Text: |-
    Laser Pointer is a Connected Lens: point things out to friends in the same room.
    
    Pinch Multiplayer to join a shared session with someone nearby.
    
    Aim at the vase and pinch to leave a colored mark on it. Hold the pinch to move the mark around. Everyone in the session sees it, and it fades a moment after you let go.
